<https://w3id.org/italia/work-accident/onto/proc21_self_liquidation/LicenzaNave> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/italia/work-accident/onto/proc21_self_liquidation/CartaDiBordoNave> .
